ph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p003","quote":"廢帝即位，授侍中、金紫光祿大夫。宣帝輔政，固以廢帝外戚，奶媼恒往來禁中，頗宣密旨，事泄，比黨皆誅，宣帝以固本無兵權，且居處清素，止免所居官，禁錮。太建中，卒于太常卿，諡恭子。","note":"按傳主、各朝年月、明文親稱與皇太子世系。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p003:r0049","surface":"宣帝","start":49,"end":51,"person_id":"icd_mkz_d9n","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p003","quote":"廢帝即位，授侍中、金紫光祿大夫。宣帝輔政，固以廢帝外戚，奶媼恒往來禁中，頗宣密旨，事泄，比黨皆誅，宣帝以固本無兵權，且居處清素，止免所居官，禁錮。太建中，卒于太常卿，諡恭子。","note":"按傳主、各朝年月、明文親稱與皇太子世系。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzhi-zizhen:p003:r0094","surface":"宣帝","start":94,"end":96,"person_id":"icd_mkz_d9n","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzhi-zizhen:p003","quote":"魏平荊州，侯瑱鎮盆城，與質不協，質率所部依於留異。陳永定二年，武帝命質率所部隨都督周文育討王琳。質與琳素善，或譖雲於軍中潛信交通，武帝命文育殺質，文育啟救之，獲免。文帝嗣位，以為五兵尚書。宣帝輔政，為司徒左長史。坐招聚博徒，免官。後為都官尚書。卒，諡曰安子。弟固。","note":"辨梁、陳兩武帝與陳世祖、高宗。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzhi-zizhen","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangzhi-zizhen-ws2478204"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p002","text":"宣帝即位，曆中書令，吏部尚書。瑒性寬和，務清靜，無所抑揚。遷尚書左僕射，加侍中，參選事。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":15,"end":16,"surface":"瑒","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p002:m0015","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作瑒。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":1752646,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":7321,"raw_end":7365,"raw_character_offsets":[7321,7322,7323,7324,7325,7326,7327,7328,7329,7330,7331